Mass login failures followed by successful login from new or unusual IPs (classic APT35 credential replay after phishing).

SigninLogs
| where ResultType != 0
| summarize FailedAttempts=count() by UserPrincipalName, IPAddress, bin(TimeGenerated, 1h)
| where FailedAttempts > 10
| join kind=inner (
    SigninLogs
    | where ResultType == 0
    | project UserPrincipalName, IPAddress, Location, TimeGenerated
) on UserPrincipalName
| where IPAddress != IPAddress1
| project UserPrincipalName, IPAddress, Location, FailedAttempts
| order by FailedAttempts desc
